    "1:ב": "Shabbos 19",
    "1:ג": "Rambam there, and he wrote likewise that it is from the Yerushalmi",
    "1:ד": "Tosafos and Rosh and Ran at the beginning of Shabbos",
    "1:ה": "Tosafos there 19, and Rosh and Ran and Mordechai there",
    "2:_": "Haggahot Maimoniyot chapter 6 in the name of Or Zarua",
    "3:_": "Ri in part 12",
    "4:א": "Tur in the name of Rabbeinu Tam and Rashba in a responsum and Haggahot Maimoniyot — he explains that Ravyah would whip one who ate it on Shabbat, end of his words",
    "4:ב": "Tur in the name of his father the Rosh in chapter 3 of Beitzah",
    "4:ג": "Haggahot Osheri there and Semak and so decided Beit Yosef",
    "5:א": "Tur in the name of Sefer HaMitzvos that some forbid, and likewise the Tur and Rabbeinu Tam, end of his words",
