    "6:ב": "Semak and Terumah",
    "7:א": "Beitzah 24, braisa, and according to R' Yehoshua",
    "7:ב": "Ri'f",
    "7:ג": "Tur in the name of Semag",
    "8:א": "From what is stated in Beitzah 25 and Eruvin 40",
    "8:ב": "There",
    "8:ג": "Ri'f and Ran and Semag and Mordechai, end of his words",
    "8:ד": "Ri and likewise Rosh",
    "8:ה": "Ran",
    "8:ו": "Rosh in chapter 4 of Eruvin",
    "9:_": "Rashba according to the view of Ri'f and the Geonim, and likewise Ran in chapter 2 of Beitzah and in chapter 22 of Shabbos, and likewise in chapter 2 of Laws of Yom Tov",
    "10:א": "Shabbos 122, mishnah",
    "10:ב": "There, braisa",
    "10:ג": "Ran in chapter 3 of Beitzah, and as the conclusion of Tosafos and Rosh",
    "10:ד": "Tosafos there 25, and likewise Mordechai in chapter 22, end of his words",
